<title>USA: Puerto Rican Cement to merge subsidiaries.</title>
<headline>Puerto Rican Cement to merge subsidiaries.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Puerto Rican Cement Co Inc said on Monday that its two subsidiaries, Concreto Mixto Inc and Ready Mix Concrete Inc would merge under the name of Ready Mix Concrete Inc on December 31.</p>
<p>Puerto Rican Cement produces cement and related products, including portland grey cement, hydrated lime, multiwall paper bags, and engages in real estate operations.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
